@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F7F8F4
skinparam noteBorderColor #8E9589
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F4F5F1
skinparam stateBorderColor #555C53
skinparam ArrowColor #555C53
title B04 状态图 · 确认、调整与入住

state "待确认" as Pending
state "已确认" as Confirmed
state "已入住" as Occupied
state "已完成" as Completed
state "已取消" as Cancelled

[*] --> Pending : 预订成功 / 占用各晚库存并开始20分钟确认期
Pending --> Confirmed : 酒店确认 [当前时刻 < 确认截止]
Pending --> Cancelled : 到期 [当前时刻 >= 确认截止] / 释放各晚库存
Pending --> Cancelled : 顾客取消 [普通操作期限内]
Confirmed --> Cancelled : 顾客取消 [普通操作期限内]
Pending --> Pending : 调整行程成功 / 更新报价并重开确认期
Confirmed --> Pending : 调整行程成功 / 更新报价并重开确认期
Confirmed --> Occupied : 办理入住 [恰有q个合规空闲房号]
Occupied --> Completed : 整单退房 / 全部已分配房间转待清洁
Cancelled --> [*]
Completed --> [*]

note left of Pending
更正入住人保留价格、状态与原截止时刻.
到期检查使用当前版本及确认截止时刻.
end note
note right of Confirmed
普通调整和取消限于订单本人,
且须早于入住日北京时间18:00及实际入住.
end note
@enduml
